__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
tests/
# `**/` for the same reason as the root .dockerignore: a bare `.env` / `.env.*`
# is anchored to this directory, so a nested one (`llm_worker/.env.local`) was
# still sent to the daemon and could be copied into a layer. `.gitignore` covers
# those paths for git and gitleaks, which is what made the image the only leak
# route and therefore the one nobody was looking at.
**/.env
**/.env.*
!.env.example
!**/.env.example
venv/
.venv/
